#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>canbuild</code>"
msgstr "Instrucción <code>canbuild</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instruction <c/>canbuild();<n/> lets you know if <a object|botbr>Builders</a>, <a object|human>Me</a> or <a object|human>Tech</a> can build a building of a given <a cbot|category>category</a>."
msgstr "La instrucción <c/>canbuild();<n/> te permite saber si los <a object|botbr>Constructores</a>, <a object|human>Yo</a> o <a object|human>Tech</a> pueden construir un edificio de una <a cbot|category>categoría</a> dada."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <a cbot|if>if</a> (canbuild(<a object|factory>BotFactory</a>))\n"
" {\n"
" \tbuild(<a object|factory>BotFactory</a>);\n"
" }"
msgstr ""

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "<c/>canbuild ( cat );<n/>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|build>build</a></code>, <code><a cbot|buildingenabled>buildingenabled</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|build>build</a></code>, <code><a cbot|buildingenabled>buildingenabled</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programación</a>, <a cbot|type>tipos</a> y <a cbot|category>categorías</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/canresearch.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>canresearch</code>"
msgstr "Instrucción <code>canresearch</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canresearch.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checks if a <a cbot|researches>research</a> can be done during current mission."
msgstr "Comprueba si se puede realizar una <a cbot|researches>investigación</a> durante la misión actual."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extern.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "The <code>extern</code> instruction  determines the <a cbot|function>function</a> that acts as main program of a robot. The name of the function declared with <code>extern</code> will apear in the program list in the lower left corner of the screen."
msgstr "La instrucción <code>extern</code> determina la <a cbot|function>función</a> que actúa como programa principal de un robot. El nombre de la función declarada con <code>extern</code> aparecerá en la lista de programas en la esquina inferior izquierda de la pantalla."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extern.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the program contains other functions, only the main function must be preceded by <code>extern</code>."
msgstr "Si el programa contiene otras funciones, solo la función principal debe ir precedida de <code>extern</code>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/false.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type <code>false</code>"
msgstr "Tipo <code>false</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/false.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "This value means that a condition is not true; it is one of the two values that a <a cbot|bool>boolean</a> <a cbot|var>variable</a> can take."
msgstr "Este valor significa que una condición no es verdadera; es uno de los dos valores que una <a cbot|var>variable</a> <a cbot|bool>booleana</a> puede tomar."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canresearch.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format const>true</format> if the research can be done (even if it is already done, to check that, use the <a cbot|researched>researched</a> instruction)\n"
"<format const>false</format> if the research cannot be done"
msgstr ""
"<format const>verdadero</format> si se puede realizar la investigación (incluso si ya está realizada, para comprobarlo usa la instrucción <a cbot|researched>researched</a>)\n"
"<format const>falso</format> si no se puede realizar la investigación"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canresearch.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot|researches>Research names</a>, <code><a cbot|research>research</a></code>, <code><a cbot|researched>researched</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot|researches>Nombres de investigaciones</a>, <code><a cbot|research>research</a></code>, <code><a cbot|researched>researched</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programación</a>, <a cbot|type>tipos</a> y <a cbot|category>categorías</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/category.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Value <code>Categories</code>"
msgstr "Valor <code>Categorías</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/category.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Categories represent the names of objects in the CBOT language. Everything in COLOBOT is an object: robots, buildings, raw materials, etc., even yourself."
msgstr "Las categorías representan los nombres de los objetos en el lenguaje CBOT. Todo en COLOBOT es un objeto: robots, edificios, materias primas, etc., incluso tú mismo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/category.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "In a program, categories are always displayed like that: <format const>category</format>. If a category isn't highlighted, it is misspelled. Caps and lower cases should be kept as is."
msgstr "En un programa, las categorías siempre se muestran así: <format const>categoría</format>. Si una categoría no aparece resaltada, está mal escrita. Las mayúsculas y minúsculas deben mantenerse tal como están."

